'''Mithril''' is a [[Dwarven Metals|Dwarven Metal]] in the {{Skill|Mining}} Collection that can be obtained in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}, {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}} and {{zone|Glacite Tunnels}} by mining Mithril veins, while having at least {{Stat|BP|4}}.

== Collection ==
Collecting '''Mithril''' increases the player's Mithril [[collections|collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of Mithril.
{{/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Mithril}}

