== Usage ==
=== {{Item|Titanium}} ===
When mining any Mithril Ore within the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}} and {{zone|Glacite Tunnels}}, there is a {{Green|2%}} base chance that [[Titanium]] Ore will spawn in its place. This chance is increased by the {{AN|Titanium Insanium}} [[Heart of the Mountain]] perk, up to {{Green|7%}}.

{{Item|Titanium}} does not spawn upon mining Mithril within the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}.

